WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.690
The centre of the galaxy, from home.

00:03.390 --> 00:07.809
Look past the spout of the Teapot, where the Milky Way is brightest.

00:08.259 --> 00:13.281
Twenty-seven thousand light-years that way is the centre of our galaxy.

00:13.731 --> 00:18.546
In the middle of it sits a black hole four million times as massive as the Sun.
